      "description": "Request rate split by HTTP status class. 5xx is server-side failure; 4xx is client-side and includes the mixed load test's expected 404 on DELETE /api/v1/admin/apps/:id.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
